	"data": "Vault Temporal Scanner Rewrite — Plan\n\nRewrite scripts/vault_temporal.py to detect time-sensitive facts in vault-style notes (frontmatter, bullet points, headers, tables) instead of first-person journal prose.\nProblem Analysis\n\nWhat's Wrong With the Current Scanner\n\nThe existing scanner (scripts/vault_temporal.py) uses regex patterns designed for first-person journal entries:\n\nThese patterns require phrases like \"I'm living in...\" or \"My salary is...\" — language that appears in audio journal…",
